  "answer": "For a medium-haul flight with an arrival delay of 4 hours, Corvina Airways does not provide compensation as per the policy. Compensation is only available for arrival delays of 3 hours or more for medium-haul flights, and the delay must be caused by circumstances within Corvina's control. A 4-hour delay is not covered under the compensation rules for medium-haul flights.",
